:: OC Enkys Cat Shelter Intro [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 5>>
You are walking down near the end of Main Street, stretching and rubbing the lingering sleep from your eyes, when you hear what sounds like a girl whimpering around the back of a building. The building appears to be an animal shelter with a fully encaged backyard to allow the animals to roam free without worry of them escaping. <span style="color:Yellow">You hear the feminine whimper again follow this time by a familiar voice.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“S- stop! Don’t paw at that!”</span> You recognize the voice, belonging to your effeminate classmate, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span>. You walk to the back, expecting to perhaps find him playing with some animals, but instead see a rather unexpected sight! <span style="color:Pink">You only see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span>’ lower half sticking out of a doggy door that leads into the store. He appears to be completely stuck and, to make matters worse, the cats seem to be having some fun with him. One of his shoes is off, being played around with by a larger tabby cat. A black cat sleeps on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span>’ lower back, napping away, while a mischievous little kitten is stretching with his paws against the back of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span>’ bottoms, unintentionally pulling them down just enough to expose the frilly, pink panties the boy is wearing. <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Enkys",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 3,
                    Arms: "Bound",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Aahhhh!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> whines, shaking his rear about to try and knock the cat away, no doubt feeling his slipping bottoms. Deciding the poor kid as suffered enough, you walk in through the back gate and pick up the kitten before <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span>’ frilly butt is exposed.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ah! Who- whose there!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> says as he hears someone step up behind him, <span style="color:Pink">his legs closing in nervousness.</span> <br>
<br>
<div id="choice">
    <<link "Smack his butt<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="color:Pink">You respond to his question with a playful smack to the rear! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> jumps at this, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ah! N- no! Leave me alone!”</span> He cries as he tries to force himself through the doggy door, but with no luck.</span> You laugh and tell him not to worry; it’s just you messing around. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>?”</span> He says, a mix of relief and embarrassment in his voice, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“S- sorry…”</span> He shifts around nervously, <span style="color:Pink">no doubt understanding just how much you can see of him in this shameful position.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <<include"OC Enkys Cat Shelter Intro 2">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
    <<link "Answer him<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You kneel down and tell him it’s just you. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>?”</span> He says, a mix of relief and embarrassment in his voice, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“S- sorry…”</span> He shifts around nervously, no doubt understanding just how much you can see of him in this shameful position. <br>
        <br>
        <<include"OC Enkys Cat Shelter Intro 2">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>

:: OC Enkys Cat Shelter Intro 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:Pink">You look over the boy’s situation, halfway stuck through a doggy door with his bottoms tugged and his pink underwear partially exposed and ask him just how exactly he got into this situation.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I… I was helping out with the k-kittens, trying to get them b-back inside, when one of them locked the door. They love messing around with the d-door handle. I thought I was small enough to squeeze through, b-but I… I got stuck.”</span> The boy slumps down, realizing he has no hope of freeing himself. He probably would have been stuck here all day until someone found him if you hadn’t shown up. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:Pink">You laugh at the admittedly humorous situation and ask if he wants some help.</span> You could give him a little push to help him squeeze through. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> <span style="color:Pink">whines once more in embarrassment before replying.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Y- yes please… J-just, be careful.”</span> You promise to be gentle as you kneel down and pick the other cat up off his back, moving it to the side <span style="color:Pink">before placing your hands on the boy’s rear and pushing with all your strength!</span> <br>
<br>
It is a bit of a process, <span style="color:LightGreen">but eventually <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> is free.</span> However, much to your amusement, <span style="color:Pink">his bottoms get caught on the doggy door just enough to slip down to his knees, giving you a brief glimpse at his pink underweared butt before he disappears behind the flap with an embarrassed cry.</span> <br>
<br>
You are standing there for about a minute, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> no doubt fixing his bottoms and working up the courage to face you, until the door is unlocked and opened. The cats all happily strut inside as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> stays at the floor nervously. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Th- thanks…”</span> You lighten the mood with a laugh and walk inside, glancing around the cozy and spacious room dedicated to the cats of the shelter. It is full of cat trees, scratching posts, cat beds, and a strange smell that you can’t decide if it’s just a little bad or really bad. Thankfully your nose gets used to it quickly. <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Enkys",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                    Blush: 2,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I volunteer here…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> says quietly after a moment of silence, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“We t-try to make it nice for the cats and other animals here, b-but the end goal is to find them a home. They need attention we j-just can’t give to all of them.”</span> A small grey cat walks up to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span>’ legs and the boy picks it up, holding it tightly, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“If- if you wanted, and aren’t that busy, I’d – I mean! – we’d love the help! I-i-if you want, whenever, no problem.”</span> He turns away blushing, holding the cat up to his face. <br>
<br>
You laugh and agree it could be nice to help out, especially if <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> is here to keep you company. He turns around with a shy smile, happy though still a little embarrassed. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I- I volunteer here on the weekends, mostly in the mornings. T- thanks…”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">You spend a few minutes getting a cute little tour and talking with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> before deciding to go, though make note of the location of the shelter in case you want to come back after.</span> <br>
<<set $InActiveQuests.delete("Enkys: Cat Shelter")>>
<<set $CompletedQuests.push("Enkys: Cat Shelter")>>
<<socialChange "Enkys" 5 1>>
<br>
[[Continue|Main Street]]
